        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: John Martin & Co.\n- Families: Hayward family\n- Events: Adelaide Christmas Pageant, Credit Union Christmas Pageant\n- Places: Adelaide\n\nFacts:\n- John Martin & Co., also known as Johnnies, was owned by the prominent Hayward family for most of its existence.\n- John Martin & Co. became an icon in Adelaide.\n- John Martin & Co. was responsible for the Adelaide Christmas Pageant.\n- Since 1996, the Adelaide Christmas Pageant has been known as the Credit Union Christmas Pageant.",
